 *         ```
 *
 *     -   Markdown heading (alternative style):
 *
 *         ```
 *         Foo
 *         ===
 *         ```
 *
 *         ```
 *         Foo
 *         ---
 *         ```
 *
 *     -   HTML heading:
 *
 *         ```
 *         <h3>Foo</h3>
 *         ```
 *
 * @private
 * @param line - Line to parse
 * @param nextLine - The line after the one to parse
 * @returns heading info
 *
